# ── Build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
dist/
*.exe
*.test
*.out
*.prof

# ── Secrets and per-host state — NEVER commit these ─────────────────────
# .env holds the Cloudflare token and your own hostnames.
.env
# The live user store. Only data/users.txt.example is tracked.
data/users.txt
# Let's Encrypt account keys and certificates.
data/certs/
# Generated by `cmd/embed-secrets` during an AIO build and deleted afterward.
# It contains your credentials, encrypted, as Go source.
cmd/server/embedded.go

# ── Local client config ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only mabo-tunnel.yml.example is tracked; a real mabo-tunnel.yml holds a token.
mabo-tunnel.yml

# ── Editor and OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
